#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:19
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QWidget, VeritasConfig)
#: rc.cpp:20
msgid ""
"Test settings.\n"
"\n"
"Select the test framework used in the project and set its detailed "
"configuration.\n"
"\n"
"Then you can add, edit and remove the test executables to be run. Once "
"added, they can be run in the tool view of the framework test.\n"
"\n"
"Note that you may not be able to add, edit or remove tests if the test "
"framework and the build manager support automatic test discovery. In that "
"case, just select the project in the tool view of the framework test and the "
"test executables will be added automatically."
msgstr ""
"Configuración das probas.\n"
"\n"
"Escolla o framework de probas que se emprega no proxecto e detalle a súa "
"configuración.\n"
"\n"
"Entón poderá engadir, editar e eliminar os executábeis de proba a executar. "
"Cando os engada, poderá executalos na vista de ferramentas do framework de "
"probas.\n"
"\n"
"Lembre que talvez non poida engadir, editar ou eliminar probas se o "
"framework de probas e o xestor de proxectos permiten descubrir "
"automaticamente as probas. Neste caso, simplemente escolla o proxecto na "
"vista de ferramentas do framework de probas e engadiranse automaticamente os "
"executábeis."

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:36
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, frameworkSelection)
#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Test framework to use"
msgstr "O framework de probas a empregar"

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:39
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox, frameworkSelection)
#: rc.cpp:32
msgid "Select the test framework used in this project."
msgstr "Escolla o framework de probas empregado neste proxecto."

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:46
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QToolButton, addExecutable)
#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Add a new test executable"
msgstr "Engade un novo executábel de probas"

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:52
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QToolButton, addExecutable)
#: rc.cpp:38
msgid ""
"Add a new test executable to be run.\n"
"The executable must use the specified framework. \n"
"\n"
"Note that you may not be able to add a new test if the test framework and "
"the build manager support automatic test discovery. In that case, just "
"select the project in the tool view of the framework test and the test "
"executables will be added automatically."
msgstr ""
"Engade un novo executábel de probas para executalo.\n"
"O executábel debe empregar o framework especificado.\n"
"Lembre que talvez non poda engadir, editar ou eliminar probas se o framework "
"de probas e o xestor de proxectos permiten descubrir automaticamente as "
"probas. Neste caso, simplemente escolla o proxecto na vista de ferramentas "
"do framework de probas e engadiranse automaticamente os executábeis."

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:62
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QToolButton, expandDetails)
#: rc.cpp:44
msgid "Expand framework details"
msgstr "Expande os detalles do framework"

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:65
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QToolButton, expandDetails)
#: rc.cpp:47
msgid "Expand the framework configuration details."
msgstr "Expande os detalles da configuración do framework."

#. i18n: file: config/veritasconfig.ui:92
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QFrame, executables)
#: rc.cpp:50
msgid ""
"The list of test executables for the selected framework.\n"
"\n"
"The list may be disabled if the test framework and the build manager support "
"automatic test discovery."
msgstr ""
"A lista de executábeis de probas do framework escollido.\n"
"\n"
"A lista pode estar desactivada se o framework de probas e o xestor de "
"proxectos soportan o descubrimento automático de probas."

